{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra Ignota</strong> is a minimalist puzzle game set aboard a sentient spaceship adrift between stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must grow <strong>symmetrical galaxies</strong> from their cores outward, fill the entire board, and solve 60 rewarding, handcrafted puzzles, all while uncovering a mysterious sci-fi story told through brief narrative episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original idea comes from the game <u>Tentai Show</u> (also known as Galaxy), by the Japanese puzzle magazine Nicoli, creators of the <strong>Sudoku</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple grid types, simple gameplay, and multiple tools that get unlocked as the story progresses. And no time pressure. It's about patience, observation, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a year in <strong>Early Access</strong> gathering feedback and polishing the experience, Astra Ignota is now ready for its full release.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 pleasant, hand-crafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite randomly-generated puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty ramps up from tutorials to devilish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touch of background story, uncovered chapter by chapter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible, no timers or reflexes required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full localization in 7 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements and cloud synchronization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Episode 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2666410/861a1fb3f4bc3285